	MAP:[Remix_PVE]Arctic_stormx
		"[Remix_PVE]Arctic Stormx"
	End			
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB01
		"[1.0:1.0] This is the Final Plan Commander, [2.0:5.0] The Allies hold their last base in Cape Alaska. [8.0:3.0] And what we're going to do is destroy what little faith they have![12.0:2.0] The scout force has been dispatched and will launch a full-scale attack in a moment!"
	End
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB02
		"[1.0:3.0] Be careful,since Allies have spotted us,it is highly likely that they will use the Chronosphere to attack."
	End	
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB03
		"[1.0:3.0] Commander,this is the ultimate weapon of the USSR: the Iron Fortress. [4.0:3.0] Its thick armour and powerful artillery will help you handle this base."
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB04
		"[1.0:3.0] Warning,Allied fleet building detected."
	End			
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB05
		"[1.0:3.0] This Soviet outpost has long been unmanned,your arrival will brought her back to life."
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB06
		"[1.0:3.0] Get in touch with the survivors of the advance force! [4.0:5.0] Commander, members of the advance party remind you to keep an eye out for Allied weather control towers, they seem to be able to deal a fair amount of damage to all of our troops!"
	End			
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB07
		"[1.0:3.0] The Allies have developed a strange weapon to protect their bases,Commander, be careful."
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB08
		"[1.0:3.0] The Allies have invoked space-class battleships in disbelief! [4.0:3.0] Commander,this is unexpected, we've reported to the Kremlin, please try to find a way to deal with it."
	End			
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB09
		"[1.0:3.0] Commander,we underestimated the power of Allied technology with the help of FutureTech. [4.0:3.0] Their space power may be enough to threaten us. [7.0:3.0] Regardless, your mission remains the same, sweep up this base, we'll rehabilitate the rest."
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB10
		"[1.0:3.0] More Zeus airships inbound!"
	End		

	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB11
		"[1.0:3.0] Commander, our engineers have revealed a beacon facility in the area with high signaling activity. [4.0:3.0] Destroying this satellite beacon may cut off the enemy space strike."
	End	

	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB12
		"[1.0:3.0] Enemy Ion Cannon connection has been cut off."
	End	
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB13
		"[1.0:3.0] Allied inshore naval base has been destroyed."
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB14
		"[1.0:3.0] An Allied commander has interfered in the battlefield via a Chronosphere,take him out if necessary"
	End

	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB15
		"[1.0:3.0] Enemy field commander has been eliminated."
	End
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB16
		"[1.0:3.0] Contact has been established,Chronosphere coordinate has been uploaded."
	End	
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB17
		"[1.0:3.0] Warning: A large amount of energy superposition has been detected."
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB18
		"[1.0:3.0] You did it, Commander. [4.0:5.0] With the Chronosphere destroyed,we can finally investigate the mystery between the Allies"
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB19
		"[1.0:3.0] Comrade,this Allied Commander has the strike coordinates of the Space Ion Cannon,don't let him decimate our troops!"
	End			

	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB20
		"[1.0:3.0]It's it, this Chronosphere, destroy it, and Allies will have nowhere to hide in the Northern Hemisphere."
	End
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB21
		"[1.0:3.0] This weapon can cause a lot of damage, but react very slowly[4.0:3.0] Commander, you can try to entice him to fire before you attack!"
	End	
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB22
		"[1.0:3.0] (Allied alarm sounds...)"
	End		
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB23
		"[1.0:3.0] Out of standard game time, special buff enabled."
	End		

	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB24
		"[1.0:3.0]We've received a vague signal of contact, Commander, you'd better go and check the source."
	End			
	
	SUBTITLE:RemixMap_MI01_SUB25
		"[1.0:3.0]Given the importance of this operation, the headquarters will fully support you,and all military equipment will be of the highest standard. [4.0:3.0] Your confidential protocols will also be authorized! Commander, just focus on the battlefield!"
	End		
	
	
	MISSIONOBJ:RemixMap_MI01_MOBJ01
		"Build up your base"
	End	
	
	MISSIONOBJ:RemixMap_MI01_MOBJ02
		"Destroy the Chronosphere"
	End		

	MISSIONOBJ:RemixMap_MI01_MOBJ03
		"Destroy the Space uplink system"
	End	
	
	MISSIONOBJ:RemixMap_MI01_MOBJ04
		"Get rid of the Allied field commander"
	End		
	
